row\"><span class=\"transport-tag\"><span class=\"transport-icon metro\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"sr-only\">Metro </span>Hôtel de Ville</span></span></div></div></article></li><li><article class=\"card\"><div class=\"card-media\"><img src=\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=cdn.paris.fr%2Fqfapv4%2F2026%2F06%2F16%2Fhuge-a5586d36b8774e55be36d75e64d9ff8a.png&amp;w=320&amp;output=webp&amp;q=72&amp;we\" srcset=\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=cdn.paris.fr%2Fqfapv4%2F2026%2F06%2F16%2Fhuge-a5586d36b8774e55be36d75e64d9ff8a.png&amp;w=320&amp;output=webp&amp;q=72&amp;we 320w, https://images.weserv.nl/?url=cdn.paris.fr%2Fqfapv4%2F2026%2F06%2F16%2Fhuge-a5586d36b8774e55be36d75e64d9ff8a.png&amp;w=640&amp;output=webp&amp;q=72&amp;we 640w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1100px) 285px, (min-width: 820px) 33vw, (min-width: 560px) 45vw, 80vw\" data-orig=\"https://cdn.paris.fr/qfapv4/2026/06/16/huge-a5586d36b8774e55be36d75e64d9ff8a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"250\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" onload=\"this.classList.add('loaded')\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null;if(this.dataset.orig){this.removeAttribute('srcset');this.src=this.dataset.orig}\"></div><div class=\"card-body\"><h3 class=\"card-title\"><a href=\"/en/poi/114153\">Oscar les vacances Concert</a></h3><p class=\"card-desc\">To mark the release of his album &quot;14 amis dans la tête&quot;, Oscar les vacances takes over the stage at the Maison des Métallos for a release party just like him: intimate, absurd, sensitive, and explosive.</p><div class=\"card-meta\"><span class=\"meta-row\"><span class=\"meta-date\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icon icon-calendar \"><path d=\"M7 2v2H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v13a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2V2h-2v2H9V2Zm-2 8h14v9H5Z\"></path></svg>Oct 24</span></span><span class=\"meta-row\"><span class=\"transport-tag\"><span class=\"transport-icon metro\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"sr-only\">Metro </span>Couronnes</span></span></di